  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Hence, number of real solution is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
